# Styles & markup

Plain CSS in `css/style.css` — no framework or preprocessor.

## BEM

Use `block__element--modifier`:

```html
<span class="row__eta row__eta--none"></span>
<div class="map-stage__map" id="focus-map"></div>
<div class="add-sheet__map"></div>
```

## Theming

- Design tokens as CSS custom properties on `:root` and `[data-theme="dark"]`
- Toggle theme via `data-theme` on `<html>`
- Do not hardcode colors in CSS when a `--token` exists
- Map route colors are the exception (`ROUTE_COLORS` in `map.js`)

## Mobile & a11y

- `viewport-fit=cover` for notched devices
- Touch-friendly targets; `aria-live="polite"` on dynamic sections (`#cards`)
- `role="button"` + keyboard (`Enter`/`Space`) for interactive rows
- `aria-label` / `aria-pressed` on theme toggle
- `aria-label` on floating `nav-dock` (above watch-sheet) and on `theme-toggle` (fixed right)

## New UI

Add styles to `style.css` following existing glass/row/focus patterns. Keep light and dark variants in sync.

Notable blocks: `map-stage` (full-bleed Leaflet background), `watch-sheet` (bottom-half liquid-glass watchlist panel), `row`, `add-sheet` (watchlist editor overlay + map; solid scrim, no backdrop blur; `add-sheet__suggestions` typeahead; map always visible; `add-sheet__map--dimmed` until direction selected), `nav-dock` (transparent positioning wrapper; circular **+** only, no outer pill), `nav-dock__add--clear` (+ rotates to × with scale pulse and slight red tint while routes are focused), `theme-toggle` (fixed right, same height as dock). Focus selection highlights only `.row--focused`, not the watch-sheet chrome. `#cards` scrolls without a visible scrollbar (`scrollbar-width: none` / `::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none }`).

Bus marker colors: `.focus-marker--bus-a` … `--bus-f` (tokens `--focus-bus` / `-b` … `-f` and `-top` variants). You marker: `.focus-marker--you` / `__you` / `__you-dot` / `__pulse` (36×36 icon, ~15px dot).

`row__remove` is layout-collapsed (`width: 0`) until `row--editing` (long-press); spacing comes from its editing margin, not `.row` gap (gap stays 0 so left/right padding match when collapsed).

Focus bus marker handoff: `focus-marker--dissolving` + `focus-marker__sand` / `__sand-chip` (Thanos-style sand blow up-and-right); `focus-marker--appearing` on the next bus. No canvas/WebGL.

Map chrome: zoom control is `topright` (above the watch-sheet); attribution sits above the sheet via bottom margin.

## When shipping UI changes

Update this file if you add a new BEM block, theme token, or a11y pattern. Also update `docs/PRD.md` per [workflow.mdc](workflow.mdc) — same turn, no prompt needed.
